
\033[32;1m --------------------------- \033[36;1mWELCOME TO GOBOREFINED\033[32;1m ---------------------------\033[0m

This is the live environment of GoboRefined,
an unofficial spin of GoboLinux 017.01.
It is a fully-functional system which can also be installed.

 * To install GoboRefined on this computer, type in:
   \033[33;1mgobo-install\033[0m
   It asks a few questions, then ERASES the disk you choose.

 * To try the graphical environment first, type in:
   \033[33;1mstartx\033[0m

 * For more information about GoboLinux, visit \033[1mhttps://gobolinux.org\033[0m

